{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35578","headline":"鄂渚清明日与乡友登头陀山 · 来鹄","name":"鄂渚清明日与乡友登头陀山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷酒一杯相劝频，异乡相遇转相亲。\n落花风里数声笛，芳草烟中无限人。\n都大此时深怅望，岂堪高处更逡巡。\n思量费子真仙子，不作头陀山下尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"来鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}